{"item": "m181", "oracle_pass": false, "evidence": "checker: Rule judge for NUM with 5% relative tolerance: parsed model=[13.05], reference=[6.5]; mismatches: #1: 13.05 != 6.5 (relative error 1.008) ", "skill_hash": "54add79d95e5", "truth_source": "checker", "skill_result": "13.05", "failure_reason": "题面中\"cyclic stress of 80 MPa\"为应力范围 Δσ = 80 MPa（峰-峰），应取应力幅 σ₀ = Δσ/2 = 40 MPa 代入迟滞回路面积公式 ΔW = πσ₀²sinδ/E；该解答误将 80 MPa 直接当作应力幅 σ₀，因 ΔW ∝ σ₀²，使耗散能及温升被高估 4 倍。"}
